Package: playdrop
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: PlayDrop maintainers <playdrop@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/QasimBhb/PlayDrop
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libgcc-s1, libfontconfig1, libxkbcommon0, libgl1, libegl1, libwayland-client0
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal
Suggests: ufw
Description: phone-to-computer link and fast local file drop
 PlayDrop links a phone and a computer over the local network. It sends
 files in both directions without an account or cloud service, resumes
 interrupted transfers, and keeps the clipboard in step.
 .
 This package installs the background service (playdropd), which starts at
 login and stays reachable while the window is closed, and the desktop
 window (playdrop-desktop).
